I posted this a while back, but here it goes again......

Since I never play in tty mode, I can't comment there.  But to get
"traditional" behavior in mac_windows mode, you need to edit the Nethack
executable's resource fork.  Open Nethack with ResEdit, and delete the
"nump" resource.  option number_pad will now behave as expected.

As is always true on a Mac, when messing with ResEdit beware.  Always work
on a copy.  You can hose yourself up but good if you hack the wrong thing
(but you can also remap the menus and keypad, if you're adventuresome :)

